OL,3,GNEWSABurnham pledges to get Stormont
OL,4,Afunctioning with budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has pledged to get
OL,7,Fthe Stormont government functioning
OL,8,Fproperly with a budget.
OL,10,FAndy Burnham told MPs at his first
OL,11,FPrime Minister's Questions that he had
OL,12,Fempowered the Northern Ireland
OL,13,FSecretary, Sir Chris Bryant, to go into
OL,14,Ftalks aimed at resolving the failure of
OL,15,Fthe Executive to agree a budget.
OL,17,FFollowing the passing of the deadline
OL,18,Frecently Stormont officials have legal
OL,19,Fpowers to spend up to 95% of last
OL,20,Fyear's funding.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
